    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your new island... and your giant new problem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 2D clicker game, you'll harvest food by clicking on crops, sell your yield, hire workers, upgrade processors, and fine-tune your whole production line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal? Gather enough food to offer a tribute to the Behemoth that visits the island. If you fail... well, let\u2019s just say the villagers won't have a good time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade, expand, automate, and do whatever it takes to survive the next tribute. Every click counts in this race against time!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your new island... and your giant new problem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 2D clicker game, you'll harvest food by clicking on crops, sell your yield, hire workers, upgrade processors, and fine-tune your whole production line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal? Gather enough food to offer a tribute to the Behemoth that visits the island. If you fail... well, let\u2019s just say the villagers won't have a good time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade, expand, automate, and do whatever it takes to survive the next tribute. Every click counts in this race against time!</p>",
